WEBVTT

00:10.690 --> 00:15.990
<i>When I throw a jab or a straight, it always lands</i>

00:15.990 --> 00:21.120
<i>But when I'm aiming for your heart, I miss every time</i>

00:21.120 --> 00:26.460
<i>Parallel, zigzagging, awkward, incoherent</i>

00:26.460 --> 00:30.960
<i>When you look my way and move closer to me</i>

00:30.960 --> 00:36.720
<i>I know it doesn't mean the same thing for you</i>

00:36.720 --> 00:41.770
<i>But I wish we could stay like this forever</i>

00:41.770 --> 00:47.900
<i>My changing feelings are driving me crazy</i>

00:47.900 --> 00:53.190
<i>The moment you turn to face me, take that! Telepathy</i>

00:53.190 --> 00:58.660
<i>If only we could feel the same thing</i>

00:58.660 --> 01:03.540
<i>I want to kick this pesky subtlety away</i>

01:03.540 --> 01:09.540
<i>I want to know everything, I want to know everything</i>

01:09.540 --> 01:12.090
<i>I can't fool you forever</i>

01:12.090 --> 01:14.720
<i>I can't keep this hidden</i>

01:14.720 --> 01:19.470
<i>I want to shout out my secret, AHHH</i>

01:21.390 --> 01:23.930
<i>Take that! Telepathy</i>

01:23.930 --> 01:26.390
<i>Te-te-te-telepathy</i>

01:27.100 --> 01:29.480
<i>Telepathy</i>

01:30.940 --> 01:34.990
<b>Goodbye, Best Friend</b>

01:31.730 --> 01:33.900
"Goodbye, Best Friend."

01:34.990 --> 01:38.740
<b>Cultural Festival</b>

01:34.990 --> 01:38.740
<b>Cultural Festival</b>

01:34.990 --> 01:38.740
<b>Uenomizu High School</b>

01:38.740 --> 01:42.240
<b>Cultural Festival</b>

01:45.250 --> 01:47.500
I can't wait to see Tomo and 
the other kids in the play.

01:47.500 --> 01:48.830
Yes!

01:48.830 --> 01:52.250
I'm so glad I got to meet Tomo-chan's 
and Misuzu-chan's moms.

01:52.540 --> 01:56.420
I don't think I'd be able to hold 
myself back if I was alone.

01:56.420 --> 01:58.470
I'll be counting on you both!

01:58.470 --> 01:59.760
To do what, now?

02:00.140 --> 02:03.560
Never thought I'd see you at 
a cultural festival, though.

02:03.560 --> 02:05.810
I guess even you love 
your own daughter, huh?

02:06.270 --> 02:10.020
She told me there wouldn't be 
a cultural festival this year.

02:10.440 --> 02:12.820
Huh? Why would she lie about that?

02:12.820 --> 02:15.780
I guess she really didn't want me seeing her.

02:16.190 --> 02:19.030
Which is why I came... to film it.

02:19.030 --> 02:20.910
It's what she gets for lying to her mother.

02:21.530 --> 02:25.540
<i>She really can't just be honest and say she 
wants to film her daughter's performance?</i>

02:28.410 --> 02:32.210
Once upon a time, in a land far away,
 there lived a young girl.

02:32.540 --> 02:34.460
Her name was Cinderella.

02:35.200 --> 02:38.050
Her stepmother and stepsisters 
were very mean to her.

02:38.050 --> 02:41.180
They forced her to do housework 
every single day without rest.

02:41.180 --> 02:43.800
Poor, pitiful Cinderella!

02:43.800 --> 02:47.930
Sob, sob. Sob, sob. Sob, sob.

02:47.930 --> 02:49.850
I wouldn't call her "pitiful"...

02:49.850 --> 02:51.600
She looks like she's out for blood.

02:53.480 --> 02:56.530
Have you finished the cleaning, Cinderella?

02:56.530 --> 02:58.530
Carol-chan!

02:59.400 --> 03:00.990
This is what you wanted us for?!

03:01.950 --> 03:05.280
Oh, I wish I could go to the ball, too.

03:05.780 --> 03:11.000
I want to dance in a beautiful dress, 
like Mother and my sisters!

03:15.340 --> 03:16.460
<i>Oh?</i>

03:16.800 --> 03:19.630
<i>No one's realized that he's there.</i>

03:19.630 --> 03:22.970
<i>He's completely concealed his presence 
and melted into the scenery.</i>

03:23.340 --> 03:26.100
<i>He is most definitely a tree!</i>

03:27.430 --> 03:31.890
Thank you, everyone, 
for coming to see me today.

03:40.110 --> 03:42.400
What a beautiful lady you are.

03:42.780 --> 03:45.910
Would you dance with me?

03:45.910 --> 03:46.830
I will.

03:50.580 --> 03:51.500
<i>Tomo...</i>

03:52.410 --> 03:53.790
<i>You really are...</i>

03:54.420 --> 03:56.340
<i>a prince to the core.</i>

03:57.170 --> 04:00.840
<i>But I bet you wish you could be a 
princess sometimes, too, right?</i>

04:01.130 --> 04:02.050
<i>I swear...</i>

04:02.470 --> 04:04.640
<i>Just try being the one who has 
to deal with you all the time.</i>

04:05.050 --> 04:07.600
<i>I was the one who instilled in you</i>

04:07.600 --> 04:10.390
<i>the sort of values that made you 
think you'd rather be a princess.</i>

04:11.020 --> 04:13.230
<i>It's not how you really feel.</i>

04:13.480 --> 04:17.190
<i>But all of it is who you are, including that.</i>

04:21.280 --> 04:24.450
I've finally found you, 
owner of the glass slipper.

04:25.030 --> 04:26.950
Will you marry me?

04:27.490 --> 04:29.870
Congratulations, Cinderella!

04:29.870 --> 04:31.750
I'm so upset, but congratulations!

04:31.750 --> 04:33.000
Congratulations!

04:33.290 --> 04:34.120
Huh?!

04:34.120 --> 04:36.250
You're supposed to be furious about this.

04:36.540 --> 04:39.090
Congrats, Cinderella! I wish you happiness!

04:39.090 --> 04:40.300
Congratulations!

04:40.300 --> 04:41.510
Congratulations!

04:43.720 --> 04:44.800
What's going on?

04:44.800 --> 04:46.510
I mean, I guess it's all good.

04:47.140 --> 04:49.890
We've been through a lot, 
but it was fun, huh?

04:50.850 --> 04:52.350
That's true.

04:52.350 --> 04:54.640
<i>This wasn't such a bad punishment.</i>

05:00.770 --> 05:03.530
<b>We Ain't Right</b>

05:00.770 --> 05:03.530
Yeah! We pulled it off!

05:03.940 --> 05:05.860
You did great, Tomo.

05:05.860 --> 05:08.660
Wanna walk around the festival with me?

05:08.990 --> 05:11.660
Oh... Sure, but...

05:12.040 --> 05:14.290
You can take that thing off now.

05:15.330 --> 05:17.580
<b>Maid Café</b>

05:17.580 --> 05:20.670
W-Welcome, master!

05:20.920 --> 05:23.300
Th-This cake is our top recommendation.

05:23.300 --> 05:24.340
Like, on the house!

05:24.340 --> 05:25.840
Wow, really?

05:25.840 --> 05:26.970
Way to go, Tomo.

05:27.720 --> 05:28.760
Here.

05:28.760 --> 05:30.640
The coffee you ordered.

05:30.640 --> 05:33.100
Drink it and, like, get the hell outta here.

05:33.100 --> 05:33.810
Huh?

05:34.350 --> 05:38.150
<b>Welcome Home, Master</b>

05:38.150 --> 05:40.400
<b>Haunted House</b>

05:46.780 --> 05:49.990
Hey, relax! The ghost is gone!

05:55.910 --> 05:56.660
Damn it!

05:56.660 --> 05:59.250
How did I lose all three rounds?!

05:59.250 --> 06:03.170
Heh! Try challenging me 
again in about ten years!

06:03.170 --> 06:05.420
We're going one more round 
once we're done eating!

06:05.420 --> 06:06.880
I won't lose this time!

06:06.880 --> 06:09.300
Sounds fun! I accept!

06:10.050 --> 06:13.060
<i>Yeah, being with him is still a total blast!</i>

06:13.600 --> 06:16.100
<i>But I'm thinking of ending what we have.</i>

06:16.100 --> 06:19.310
<i>Is that really what I want?</i>

06:25.320 --> 06:27.440
Isn't this fun, Ko-chan?

06:27.440 --> 06:28.070
Yeah...

06:28.070 --> 06:30.530
Aizawa-san! Please dance with me!

06:30.530 --> 06:31.780
And then me!

06:31.780 --> 06:32.830
Me, too! Me, too!

06:32.830 --> 06:33.580
Whoa, hang—

06:33.580 --> 06:35.540
Tomo... You wanna dance with me?

06:35.540 --> 06:39.670
Huh?! W-Well, sure, I guess...

06:40.370 --> 06:42.840
Wh-What?! Stop clapping!

06:45.250 --> 06:50.090
<i>What am I expecting will happen 
if I stand around here?</i>

06:50.090 --> 06:53.430
Hey, Misuzu-chan. Do you 
wanna dance with me?

06:53.430 --> 06:55.100
What? Didn't you hear me?

06:55.640 --> 06:59.350
<i>They both have someone to spend 
the festival after-party with.</i>

06:59.690 --> 07:02.230
<i>They don't have time to waste on m—</i>

07:03.440 --> 07:05.900
Sorry. Have you been waiting?

07:09.570 --> 07:11.610
I suppose I should thank you.

07:12.110 --> 07:13.070
So thanks.

07:13.070 --> 07:14.450
Huh? For what?

07:14.450 --> 07:16.410
Did I do something?

07:16.410 --> 07:18.250
Don't play dumb with me.

07:18.250 --> 07:22.790
You got me the Cinderella role so 
I'd make up with Tomo, didn't you?

07:23.290 --> 07:24.840
You were fighting?

07:24.840 --> 07:25.340
Huh?

07:25.710 --> 07:28.300
This is all I was after.

07:29.050 --> 07:31.010
Give me that! I'm deleting it!

07:30.340 --> 07:32.550
No!

07:32.930 --> 07:35.600
Th-This is more embarrassing than I expected.

07:35.600 --> 07:37.310
Yeah... it is.

07:38.100 --> 07:41.730
Never thought you'd ask me to dance.

07:41.730 --> 07:44.360
I know you were just asking as a friend,

07:44.360 --> 07:47.320
but y'know, if you ask me like 
that in front of people,

07:47.320 --> 07:50.110
they might get the wrong idea.

07:51.030 --> 07:53.950
It's not... wrong.

07:54.660 --> 07:55.120
Huh?

07:56.580 --> 07:58.160
They wouldn't be wrong.

07:59.790 --> 08:01.710
Huh? Tomo-chan?

08:02.250 --> 08:03.040
Tomo?

08:17.930 --> 08:18.930
It's cold...

08:19.310 --> 08:21.180
Morning, Jun!

08:21.640 --> 08:24.060
Don't get all shriveled up just 'cause it's cold!

08:24.310 --> 08:26.770
Get those spirits up and let's go!

08:26.770 --> 08:29.230
<i>Tomo's been like this ever since that day.</i>

08:29.690 --> 08:32.740
<i>At a glance, she just seems 
super energetic, but...</i>

08:32.740 --> 08:35.700
So then, y'know what Misuzu did?

08:34.910 --> 08:38.370
Hey, Tomo, about the after-party...

08:38.780 --> 08:42.750
O-Oh, yeah! I just remembered I need to 
get to school early to do something!

08:46.380 --> 08:50.800
<i>Should I take this as a rejection?</i>

08:52.760 --> 08:55.010
Morning, Misuzu-chan!

08:55.010 --> 08:56.050
Good morning.

08:58.720 --> 09:02.220
Look at this, Tomo-chan! I'm hugging her,
 and she's not getting mad!

09:02.220 --> 09:03.180
It's a miracle!

09:03.480 --> 09:06.650
Well, Misuzu really hates being cold.

09:06.650 --> 09:08.940
You must be warming her up by hugging her.

09:08.940 --> 09:12.280
I wish it'd stay winter forever!

09:19.660 --> 09:21.740
Hey, where's Jun-kun?

09:21.740 --> 09:23.500
He didn't come with you today?

09:23.500 --> 09:25.460
Huh? O-Oh, yeah...

09:25.460 --> 09:29.080
He came with me part of the 
way, b-but stuff happened...

09:29.080 --> 09:33.170
Hey, Tomo-chan, did something happen 
between you two at the cultural festival?

09:33.170 --> 09:35.510
Huh?! B-Between me and Jun?!

09:35.510 --> 09:39.800
N-No, nothing at all! So much nothing 
that it's killing me, actually!

09:43.310 --> 09:45.100
Something did happen.

09:45.100 --> 09:46.690
I knew it.

09:46.690 --> 09:50.190
Junichiro probably said something that 
amounted to confessing his feelings,

09:50.190 --> 09:52.520
and she chose to run away from him.

09:52.520 --> 09:55.990
Why, though? Their feelings 
were finally mutual.

09:55.990 --> 09:57.400
Why? I mean...

10:05.120 --> 10:06.370
Morning, Jun-kun.

10:06.370 --> 10:07.830
Oh, hey.

10:08.330 --> 10:09.790
Is something wrong?

10:12.750 --> 10:16.720
The thing is... there's someone I like.

10:16.970 --> 10:19.640
Wait, are you saying it's...

10:19.640 --> 10:20.430
It's Tomo.

10:23.350 --> 10:25.100
What'd you do that for?

10:25.100 --> 10:28.600
S-Sorry! I was just so happy, 
I couldn't stop myself!

10:29.440 --> 10:32.860
So... what do you think I should do?

10:34.530 --> 10:35.530
Well...

10:36.070 --> 10:39.150
If I told you there was a good way 
to handle it, would you do it?

10:41.410 --> 10:45.540
I think the best thing you can do is 
tell her straight-up that you like her.

10:46.000 --> 10:50.290
I think that's the thing that'll 
work best for you two.

10:50.290 --> 10:52.880
Wait, did I sound kinda patronizing there?

10:53.380 --> 10:54.420
No.

10:55.840 --> 10:58.720
Thank you for the advice.

10:58.720 --> 11:00.090
No, it was nothing!

11:00.090 --> 11:05.260
To be honest, I'm not really in any 
position to give anyone love advice.

11:05.600 --> 11:11.810
I'm only going out with Carol now 
because someone set the stage for me.

11:11.810 --> 11:14.060
I didn't do any of the work on my own.

11:14.860 --> 11:18.280
So now that she's accepted me 
even knowing that's how I am,

11:18.280 --> 11:23.160
I want to get all the feelings across 
to her that I never could before.

11:23.870 --> 11:26.950
Telling someone you like 
them isn't easy to do.

11:26.950 --> 11:28.540
It's really scary, even.

11:29.160 --> 11:30.410
So let's both give it our all.

11:33.080 --> 11:34.170
Right.

11:35.040 --> 11:36.420
<i>I've decided what to do.</i>

11:37.210 --> 11:39.670
<i>I'm going to tell her how I feel up-front.</i>

11:40.670 --> 11:44.430
<i>But there are some steps I need to take first.</i>

11:49.810 --> 11:53.440
Got a minute to talk, Gundo?

11:58.440 --> 11:59.650
Gundo...

12:00.690 --> 12:04.450
Sorry. I'm in love with Tomo.

12:04.740 --> 12:05.570
Huh?

12:06.200 --> 12:08.700
What does that have to do with me?

12:08.700 --> 12:10.410
Just... sorry.

12:10.410 --> 12:12.080
What are you apologizing for?

12:12.410 --> 12:15.830
I'm pretty sure, ever since 
you and I went out...

12:15.830 --> 12:18.750
No, even before that, I already loved her.

12:19.250 --> 12:24.590
So I realize it's selfish of me 
to tell you I love her <i>now</i>.

12:26.430 --> 12:32.430
Wait... Are you saying <i>that's</i> why you 
couldn't be more proactive with Tomo?

12:32.430 --> 12:34.350
That's not all of it, but...

12:34.810 --> 12:37.940
<i>I can't believe he was 
still worried about me.</i>

12:38.400 --> 12:40.110
<i>I swear, he's such a...</i>

12:40.610 --> 12:43.740
Hey, you okay? Does your head hurt?

12:43.740 --> 12:44.990
Don't get cocky!

12:45.570 --> 12:49.450
Do you think our brief relationship 
happened at <i>your</i> discretion?

12:49.910 --> 12:53.080
<i>I</i> picked it up and <i>I</i> threw it away!

12:53.080 --> 12:54.620
It was <i>my</i> mistake!

12:54.830 --> 12:56.670
A huge mistake.

12:56.670 --> 13:00.090
If you're being considerate of me,
 forget about it right now.

13:00.090 --> 13:00.880
Got it?

13:00.880 --> 13:02.630
Y-Yeah...

13:04.340 --> 13:05.590
Thanks.

13:05.590 --> 13:08.470
Huh? I didn't do anything to be thanked for.

13:08.470 --> 13:11.310
No, not just for today.

13:11.930 --> 13:14.940
You've always been pretty good at 
looking out for others, y'know?

13:15.310 --> 13:17.060
It's just a feeling,

13:17.060 --> 13:21.230
but I'm pretty sure I only made 
it to this point because of you.

13:21.690 --> 13:22.940
Am I wrong?

13:22.940 --> 13:26.740
I swear. He and Tomo both...

13:27.490 --> 13:29.200
I disagree.

13:29.200 --> 13:31.830
Thanks for hearing me out.

13:31.830 --> 13:33.410
Let's head back to class.

13:33.410 --> 13:34.290
Wait.

13:34.870 --> 13:36.710
Tell me one last thing.

13:37.540 --> 13:39.210
Was I...

13:40.000 --> 13:41.340
your first love?

13:41.550 --> 13:43.340
F-First love?!

13:43.840 --> 13:46.050
No... you weren't.

13:46.720 --> 13:49.760
I see. So I wasn't your first, then.

13:50.510 --> 13:53.390
Incidentally, I've never 
been in love with anyone.

13:54.430 --> 13:55.980
Oh, is that so?!

13:55.980 --> 13:57.480
I really can't stand you!

14:05.110 --> 14:06.280
What's this?

14:07.400 --> 14:10.780
<b>Letter of Challenge 

Aizawa Tomo, 
I challenge you to a duel. 
Wait for me on the rooftop today after school.</b>

14:10.780 --> 14:12.790
A challenge letter?!

14:13.120 --> 14:17.830
Yo! What idiot tried to 
pick a fight with me?!

14:21.380 --> 14:23.840
J-Jun?! You tricked me!

14:23.840 --> 14:24.880
Yep.

14:24.880 --> 14:27.300
I didn't think you'd actually 
fall for it, though.

14:27.720 --> 14:30.510
<i>It's all over! I can't get away!</i>

14:31.850 --> 14:32.810
Tomo...

14:33.930 --> 14:34.970
Please...

14:35.560 --> 14:37.020
Please hit me!

14:37.020 --> 14:37.850
Wha?!

14:38.270 --> 14:41.610
And why do I have to hit you?

14:41.610 --> 14:43.440
Because I deserve to be hit.

14:43.440 --> 14:44.650
What the hell?!

14:45.110 --> 14:48.740
I don't have any reason to...

14:48.740 --> 14:50.660
Right after we started high school,

14:51.120 --> 14:53.490
when we were standing 
under those cherry trees,

14:53.490 --> 14:55.410
you told me you loved me.

14:55.950 --> 14:58.410
I love you, Jun!

14:58.960 --> 14:59.960
Huh?

14:59.960 --> 15:04.500
You didn't just mean "as a friend," did you?

15:07.170 --> 15:10.930
You realized I was confessing to you?

15:10.930 --> 15:11.840
Yeah.

15:11.840 --> 15:14.390
You knew how I felt?

15:14.390 --> 15:15.220
That's right.

15:15.640 --> 15:16.890
And you knew...

15:17.520 --> 15:21.900
that I was trying so hard to 
be more girly just for you...

15:21.900 --> 15:23.860
and you were just ignoring it?!

15:23.860 --> 15:26.570
You were trying to be more girly... for me?

15:26.570 --> 15:29.110
S-Sorry... I didn't know about tha—

15:34.950 --> 15:36.370
Ow...

15:36.830 --> 15:38.660
<i>I hit him.</i>

15:39.410 --> 15:41.580
<i>I don't even have any right to hit him.</i>

15:43.040 --> 15:45.750
<i>I can understand wanting to 
run away painfully well.</i>

15:46.670 --> 15:48.800
<i>Jun must have been afraid, too.</i>

15:49.300 --> 15:53.550
<i>But right now, he's looking right 
at me and not running away.</i>

15:54.010 --> 15:57.100
<i>I'm the one running away now!</i>

16:01.350 --> 16:02.730
Wait!

16:03.310 --> 16:06.770
I know your feelings might 
have changed by now.

16:07.400 --> 16:11.280
But even if they have, I still...

16:11.650 --> 16:12.450
love you!

16:13.410 --> 16:14.450
Shut up, dumbass!

16:14.910 --> 16:16.120
Dumbass?!

16:19.870 --> 16:20.830
Dumbass...

16:22.710 --> 16:24.830
I blew it!

16:25.250 --> 16:28.840
So then you called him a 
dumbass and ran away, huh?

16:28.840 --> 16:31.340
I mean... I just freaked out!

16:31.340 --> 16:32.970
"Dumbass" was just mean, though.

16:32.970 --> 16:35.340
Quit rubbing salt in the wound!

16:35.590 --> 16:39.140
You know you love each other now.
 You should just go out.

16:39.140 --> 16:41.520
What does "going out" even mean?

16:41.520 --> 16:42.350
Huh?

16:42.640 --> 16:44.810
What makes it different 
from the way we are now?

16:44.810 --> 16:47.520
How are Jun and I supposed to be?

16:47.520 --> 16:50.610
Is everything just gonna work out, 
even though I don't understand anything?

16:51.030 --> 16:53.030
What if I screw it up?

16:53.450 --> 16:54.410
<i>Tomo...</i>

16:54.740 --> 16:58.580
<i>You've always called me your best friend,</i>

16:59.120 --> 17:03.870
<i>but this is the first time we've 
really faced each other head-on.</i>

17:07.040 --> 17:07.920
Tomo...

17:08.590 --> 17:11.760
I want you to listen carefully 
to what I'm about to tell you.

17:11.760 --> 17:12.590
Huh?

17:12.590 --> 17:15.380
Because I'm pretty sure I'll 
only be able to say it once.

17:23.770 --> 17:25.140
I'm sorry.

17:25.140 --> 17:30.270
What's going on between you and 
Junichiro now is all my fault.

17:30.270 --> 17:33.530
Huh? No way! I should be thanking you for—

17:33.530 --> 17:34.610
You shouldn't.

17:35.110 --> 17:38.160
There was never any need to force 
yourself to be more girly.

17:38.820 --> 17:41.410
You were just fine the way you were.

17:42.870 --> 17:47.290
No one ever... wanted you to change.

17:47.500 --> 17:48.960
M-Misu—

17:48.960 --> 17:50.790
A-A-Are you... crying?!

17:50.790 --> 17:51.880
I am not.

17:53.880 --> 17:55.550
Sorry, Misuzu.

17:55.920 --> 17:59.720
I guess I kinda backed you into a corner.

18:00.180 --> 18:03.600
I put myself in a corner. That's all.

18:04.020 --> 18:05.390
But more importantly...

18:05.770 --> 18:08.980
Just go to him and settle all this.

18:08.980 --> 18:11.360
Like you always do. Right?

18:11.860 --> 18:13.070
Misuzu...

18:14.320 --> 18:17.450
I'm so glad you're my best friend!

18:17.860 --> 18:19.110
Yeah, yeah.

18:24.950 --> 18:27.160
Love sure is nice.

18:27.160 --> 18:30.790
With the one you love, you can 
be stubborn, cry, throw a fit...

18:30.790 --> 18:33.340
And they'll understand that 
that's just the way it goes.

18:33.880 --> 18:38.840
My feelings are so incomprehensible, 
no one would ever understand them.

18:40.390 --> 18:43.640
I don't think it matters whether 
someone's a friend or a love interest.

18:44.010 --> 18:46.850
It's okay to have lots of 
different types of love.

18:47.770 --> 18:51.190
You and I are just friends,

18:51.190 --> 18:52.980
but I still want to kiss you.

18:52.230 --> 18:53.520
Get off me.

18:55.860 --> 18:56.740
Jun!

18:58.110 --> 18:59.200
Tomo?

18:59.990 --> 19:03.240
Sorry about before! I won't run away again!

19:03.240 --> 19:07.500
So just give me one more... one more chance!

19:12.170 --> 19:14.920
I just want to make sure I understood.

19:15.250 --> 19:20.050
So you really... l-love me?

19:20.260 --> 19:21.840
Yes, I do!

19:21.840 --> 19:22.930
Really?!

19:22.930 --> 19:23.850
Yes!

19:23.850 --> 19:25.260
Really for real?!

19:25.260 --> 19:26.470
Yes, for real!

19:27.140 --> 19:30.600
<i>Jun really, actually loves me!</i>

19:30.600 --> 19:33.270
<i>As a man... and he loves me as a girl!</i>

19:33.650 --> 19:37.940
<i>I never thought this day would come!
 It feels like a dream!</i>

19:38.530 --> 19:41.280
<i>But that also means...</i>

19:42.530 --> 19:44.700
You're really sure about that?

19:44.700 --> 19:45.530
Huh?

19:45.530 --> 19:49.250
After today, you and I might 
not be best buds anymore.

19:49.250 --> 19:51.040
You're okay with that?

19:51.250 --> 19:54.130
Not best buds anymore? Why?

19:54.460 --> 19:57.710
Are you saying you don't wanna...
 g-go out with me?!

19:57.710 --> 19:59.050
I'm not saying that!

19:59.050 --> 20:01.380
So we can't stay best buds, then, can we?!

20:01.380 --> 20:02.800
I don't wanna quit that, either!

20:02.800 --> 20:04.470
How selfish can you be?!

20:04.680 --> 20:07.970
What do you want us to be, then?!

20:07.970 --> 20:09.270
Well, I mean...

20:10.350 --> 20:11.810
For example...

20:13.310 --> 20:15.230
Ready... go!

20:15.230 --> 20:15.900
Huh?!

20:15.900 --> 20:18.150
Hey! Wait up, damn it!

20:25.410 --> 20:27.450
I still can't beat you, huh?

20:27.450 --> 20:30.660
Wh-Why the hell did you suddenly take off?

20:31.210 --> 20:33.250
This is what I want.

20:34.250 --> 20:37.340
This is the relationship 
I want to have with you.

20:37.340 --> 20:38.090
Huh?

20:40.170 --> 20:44.930
Even if you and I get together as a couple,

20:45.510 --> 20:48.890
I still want us to compete with 
each other, like we always have.

20:49.180 --> 20:53.640
Well, sure, I have fun competing 
with you, too, but...

20:53.640 --> 20:56.900
Is that how it's supposed to be 
when a guy and a girl go out?

20:57.400 --> 21:00.190
Maybe it's not actually that simple.

21:00.190 --> 21:01.110
But...

21:01.900 --> 21:06.160
I still want to treasure all 
the time we've spent together.

21:06.450 --> 21:13.040
You're my childhood friend, 
my best bud, my rival, and...

21:14.040 --> 21:15.620
the girl I love.

21:16.960 --> 21:18.590
Is that not good enough?

21:22.210 --> 21:26.760
<i>Your best bud, your rival, and 
your girlfriend? What the heck?</i>

21:27.390 --> 21:31.350
<i>But maybe... if it's okay to be that selfish...</i>

21:32.330 --> 21:33.180
Jun!

21:35.320 --> 21:36.920
Jun, I...

21:38.910 --> 21:40.030
love you, too!

21:46.190 --> 21:47.960
Jun!

21:50.450 --> 21:51.570
Hey!

21:51.570 --> 21:53.820
Answer me! You alive?!

21:54.680 --> 21:55.480
Yes!

21:55.480 --> 21:56.960
What?!

21:57.950 --> 21:59.960
Yes!

22:10.850 --> 22:14.600
<i>(This suspicious behavior is...)</i>

22:14.600 --> 22:18.900
<i>Hey, you know, I'm all mixed up</i>

22:18.900 --> 22:23.360
<i>It's too complicated, I'm freaking out</i>

22:23.360 --> 22:25.900
<i>I want to look cute to you</i>

22:23.690 --> 22:29.240
<i>(crazy, crazy, drive me crazy, and that's…)</i>

22:25.900 --> 22:28.530
<i>So I'm plotting, bargaining, 
sly, and stubborn</i>

22:29.240 --> 22:33.040
<i>Dizzying love</i>

22:34.200 --> 22:38.620
<i>Just tell him to look at you</i>

22:38.620 --> 22:43.590
<i>And watch him stiffen up even more, 
because you're both so awkward</i>

22:43.590 --> 22:47.470
<i>What? Even if we're alike in that way</i>

22:47.470 --> 22:52.050
<i>It doesn't make me happy, 'cause it
 means our love is going nowhere</i>

22:52.050 --> 23:00.940
<i>Cloudy heart, swirling emotions—
I sense rain coming</i>

23:00.940 --> 23:10.030
<i>So I partly open my umbrella, 
then sneakily scoot closer to you</i>

23:10.030 --> 23:13.990
<i>Please notice the curl of my 
eyelashes as I keep blinking</i>

23:13.990 --> 23:18.910
<i>And don't say I'm acting weird</i>

23:18.910 --> 23:22.880
<i>All this plotting and bargaining 
is my sly plan to look cute to you</i>

23:22.880 --> 23:27.920
<i>Try to solve the riddle of 
this soft, dizzying love</i>

23:25.800 --> 23:30.050
<i>(Buzzing, fidgeting)</i>

23:30.300 --> 23:34.850
<i>Listen, I might be a bit 
tangled in my own web now</i>

23:34.850 --> 23:38.890
<i>But once you unravel the mystery, 
you'll see pure lo-love</i>
